WEBVTT

00:00:00.910 --> 00:00:03.450
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:08.730
I'll hold on to your data.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.190
Don’t do it!

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:11.860
Don’t do it!

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:16.700
Flame, I won't forget this hate!

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:20.870
I'm cursing you!

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.350
Windy was…

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:32.460
Boss!  Since he lost, 
that means we’re free!

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:41.510
Lightning didn’t save Windy this time.

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:43.770
No second chances.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:46.970
I don’t care which Ignis loses first.

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:50.230
They must all be destroyed.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:54.000
Only Bohman and Lightning are left.

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:16.340
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:23.130
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:30.450
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:37.020
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:43.770
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:51.000
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:57.710
I want to share your pain

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:32.300
Why did Haru show up in front of us?

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:39.360
Bohman and Lightning may be nearby.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:40.970
You’re right.

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:46.950
Mirror LINK VRAINS.

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:50.220
It’s spooky when there's no one around.

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:54.540
He didn’t recreate the humans.

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:08.810
Message from SOL Technologies:

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:13.940
We apologize for LINK VRAINS's 
continued instability.

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:18.110
We're investigating the cause, 
so please wait for a while.

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:22.180
C'mon!  How long is a while?

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.120
Ten minutes?  An hour?

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:28.090
I only wait longer for Blue 
Angel handshake events!

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:33.060
We repeat: We apologize for LINK 
VRAINS's continued instability.

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:35.440
We're investigating the cause-

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:38.200
What’s happening, Ghost Girl?

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:49.770
What’s that building?

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:52.590
That's where Central 
Station is supposed to be.

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:55.850
Something may be there.  Let’s go.

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:10.410
I knew you’d come, Blue Maiden.  And Aqua.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:11.870
Bohman…

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:15.110
I was waiting for you to arrive.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:19.570
Ta daa!  We’re free-

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:22.550
We’re not, Boss.

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:26.310
Next up is Bohman!

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:28.390
Blue Maiden is his opponent!

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:32.610
What incredible duel will we get to see?

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:35.330
Film it!  Make sure to film it!

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.970
Right!

00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:40.230
The broadcast is starting again!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:46.610
I can never forgive him.

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:49.590
Mirror World?

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:50.470
Yes.

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:56.070
The Ignis rebelling against the 
humans recreated LINK VRAINS.

00:04:56.070 --> 00:05:00.050
Why would the Ignis do that?

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:05.380
Playmaker’s team invaded 
Mirror World to find out.

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:07.170
Along with Revolver.

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:08.530
Revolver?

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:11.520
They teamed up with the Knights of Hanoi?

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.060
By happenstance.

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:14.540
Happenstance?

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:18.010
It's from Playmaker’s ally.

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:19.970
It's visuals of Mirror World.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.970
The man is Bohman.

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:27.040
The other is Blue Maiden.  Your sister.

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:28.540
What?

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:30.670
I’m Bohman.

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:35.510
The next-gen Ignis that Lightning 
created for the AI’s future.

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:40.750
Aqua, for the AI's future, 
let me handle everything.

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:44.670
Is that what Lightning ordered you to do?

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:47.730
I won't entrust the future to you.

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:52.710
Lightning imprisoned me and 
destroyed Cyberse World!

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.900
I can't trust him!

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.900
Ordered by Lightning?

00:05:57.900 --> 00:06:00.720
You misunderstand badly.

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:05.650
Lightning created me, but I'm not his puppet.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:13.200
As his superior, I was created to 
unite all Ignis.  Including him.

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:15.360
That’s who I am.

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:20.090
My will is completely 
independent from Lightning.

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:25.090
No one asked Lightning 
to create your existence.

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:29.830
Lightning created you, ignoring our wishes!

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:35.070
So you deny my existence.

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:37.050
It can’t be helped.

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:39.790
Then what should I do?

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:46.810
Don’t work with Lightning, 
stop harming people and be free.

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:51.020
I see.  And if I can’t do that?

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:52.970
Simple.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:58.930
Once upon a time, there were those who 
wanted to conquer a peaceful world by force.

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:02.400
Humans call that an invasion.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:06.370
And those individuals attacked the humans.

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:10.110
My dear friend was also targeted.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:13.350
She's still in a deep sleep.

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:15.380
Dear friend?

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:16.730
Stop acting dumb!

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:19.950
Miyu Sugisaki.

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:25.020
Aqua’s partner.  Lightning 
stole her consciousness.

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:31.400
No matter the reason, I can’t forgive you!

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:36.470
Miyu Sugisaki...  I remember her.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:37.640
That child…

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:42.800
So Miyu was also a victim 
of the Lost Incident.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.200
That child…

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:47.650
I came here to restore 
Miyu’s consciousness.

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:54.620
Your intentions are direct 
and simple.  It's wonderful.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:59.360
In other words, we'll have to fight.

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:01.090
Seems so.

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:08.340
If you defeat me in this duel, I'll give you 
the vaccine data to restore her consciousness.

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.340
You’re quite confident.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:14.310
It sounds like you’re 
saying I can’t defeat you.

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:17.040
Take it that way if you want.

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:19.290
That's a promise.

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:21.560
Duel!

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:29.720
Bohman must know that we 
defeated his brother Haru.

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:33.140
He'll strike us with anger and hatred.

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:34.870
Be careful.

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:39.710
He doesn’t seem like he'd 
have such kind feelings.

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:42.900
Here I go!  My turn!

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:44.440
It’s started.

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:46.870
Blue Maiden is going first.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:50.650
I summon Marincess Sea Horse from my hand!

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:57.320
Shine!  The circuit of friendship and bonds!

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:01.290
The summoning condition is one 
Level 4 or lower Marincess!

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.490
Link Summon!

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:07.350
Link 1 Marincess Blue Slug!

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:14.240
When it's summoned, I add Sea Horse 
from my graveyard to my hand.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.500
And due to Sea Horse’s own effect,

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:20.250
it’s Special Summoned next to a 
Marincess Link Monster’s link!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:25.560
She used the Sea Horse that 
she returned to her hand.

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:27.610
She's logical with no wasted actions.

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:31.020
It feels weird to be praised by an AI.

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:32.750
But I’m only getting started!

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:36.230
Shine!  The circuit of friendship and bonds!

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:39.860
The summoning conditions 
are two Water monsters!

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:41.830
Link Summon!

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:46.340
Appear!  Link 2 Marincess Coral Anemone!

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.480
Coral Anemone’s effect activates!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:54.860
I Special Summon a Water monster 
from my graveyard next to its link!

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.280
Resurrect, Blue Slug!

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.880
Shine!  The circuit of friendship and bonds!

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:06.180
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Water monsters!

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:12.870
Appear!  Link 3 Marincess Marbled Rock!

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:15.570
Coral Anemone’s effect activates!

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:21.580
When it's sent to the graveyard, I add one 
Marincess in the graveyard to my hand!

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:25.900
She summoned a Link 3 without reducing 
the number of cards in her hand.

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:28.040
Her Marincess Deck is impressive!

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:30.950
I set one card.

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:32.840
I end my turn.

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:46.030
Watch, Haru.

00:10:46.030 --> 00:10:49.630
I won’t let your life go to waste.

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:51.090
My turn.

00:10:51.090 --> 00:10:52.180
I draw.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.540
Here he comes.

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:58.540
When there are no monsters 
in our Main Monster Zones...

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:02.110
...I can Special Summon Hydradrive 
Booster from my hand.

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:07.490
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:10.760
The summoning condition is one Hydradrive.

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:11.950
Link Summon.

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:15.190
Link 1 Coolant Hydradrive!

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:21.930
When a Water monster is on your field, 
Coolant Hydradrive can attack you directly!

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:27.600
I Special Summon a second 
Hydradrive Booster from my hand.

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:33.550
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:38.980
Link 1 Coolant Hydradrive!

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:45.920
Since a Link Marker is pointing towards the 
Spell & Trap Zone, I activate a Link Spell!

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:46.950
Here it comes!

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:48.120
Link Spell!

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:50.930
The three arrows that judge the world!

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:53.830
Link Spell, Judgment Arrows!

00:11:55.290 --> 00:12:01.010
I summon a third Hydradrive 
Booster from my hand.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:07.240
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:09.710
Link Summon.

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:12.940
Link 1 Coolant Hydradrive!

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:16.600
He has three Coolant Hydradrives.

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:22.060
Hey!  They can all attack directly?

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:29.030
And due to Judgment Arrows, the two not in 
the Extra Monster Zone have their ATK doubled.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:33.620
That means... 5000 damage?

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:36.010
If she takes that, she’s finished!

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:40.170
A Hydradrive Deck can oppose any Attribute.

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:42.010
It’s strong.

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:45.010
He set up a counterstrategy 
after seeing Haru’s duel.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:50.260
Marbled Rock's effect can 
break out of this situation.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:55.450
And there are three Marincess 
monsters in my hand.

00:12:57.680 --> 00:12:59.660
I can strike back!

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:03.130
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:07.960
The summoning conditions are three 
Hydradrive Link Monsters with the same Attribute!

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:11.070
Why?  What’s going on?

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:15.470
He can deal 5000 damage, 
but he’s not attacking?

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:18.210
As usual, I don’t understand him.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.180
Link Summon.

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:25.880
Link 3 Cubic Hydradrive Lord!

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:36.590
A new Hydradrive monster.

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:38.330
That’s what he was going for.

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:44.340
You only predicted one of 
my patterns for victory.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:48.090
And I chose a better pattern.

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:50.350
That’s all there is to it.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:55.620
Meaning its effect is more 
powerful than Coolant's.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.080
Exactly.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:03.060
Due to Cubic Hydradrive Lord, your 
path of retreat has been blocked.

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:11.140
When it's summoned, I choose two 
of Water, Wind or Fire Attributes.

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:14.430
And it gains those Attributes, 
in addition to Earth.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:17.680
I choose Water and Fire!

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:24.150
Earth, Water and Fire.

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:26.610
A monster with three Attributes.

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:30.730
Due to Cubic Hydradrive Lord’s effect...

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:36.290
...if your monster has the same Attribute 
as mine, its effects are negated.

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:38.090
Property Zero!

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:46.740
Marbled Rock’s effects have been negated!

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:49.580
Go, Cubic Hydradrive Lord!

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:52.700
Attack Marincess Marbled Rock!

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:57.920
The Link Spell, Judgment Arrows’s effect!

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:07.350
Aoi!

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:09.720
She managed to survive.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:15.640
He gave up 5000 points of direct 
damage to summon that Link Monster.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.670
There has to be more.

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:26.790
Judgment Arrows’s effect ends, and Cubic 
Hydradrive Lord’s ATK return to normal.

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:32.110
Then Cubic Hydradrive 
Lord’s effect acitvates!

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:37.420
When it destroys a monster with 
the same Attribute in battle...

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:40.830
...Cubic Hydradrive Lord can attack again.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.010
This is bad!

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:44.060
If she takes this, it’s over!

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.790
I won’t allow that!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:49.040
I activate the trap card, Marincess Snow!

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:54.570
I Link Summon a Marincess 
from my Extra Deck with fewer

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:58.550
Link Markers than the destroyed Marincess!

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:02.770
Appear!  Marincess Crystal Heart!

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.750
Crystal Heart!

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:16.350
It’s a new Crystal Heart that 
carries on Earth’s memories.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:22.100
Earth, please lend us your strength.

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:28.580
When Crystal Heart is Special Summoned by 
Marincess Snow, it’s not affected by your effects!

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.950
Property Zero is negated!

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:36.050
All right!  But she's not out of trouble yet.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:38.790
My battle isn’t over yet!

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:41.570
Go, Cubic Hydradrive Lord!

00:16:41.570 --> 00:16:44.330
Attack Marincess Crystal Heart!

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:46.450
What?

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:49.690
Marincess Crystal Heart’s effect activates!

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:57.530
When your monster attacks it, by sending one 
Marincess in my hand to the graveyard...

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:02.830
...Crystal Heart isn’t destroyed in 
battle, and battle damage becomes 0!

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:15.550
Judgment Arrows didn't raise 
its ATK during this attack.

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:18.230
That must be Crystal Heart’s effect too.

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:24.720
I thought I got Aoi involved 
in situations related

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:29.930
to the Lost Incident because 
I work at SOL Technologies.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:37.140
It's my responsibility to raise 
Aoi until she’s grown up.

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:43.150
That’s why I tried to keep 
her away from LINK VRAINS.

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:51.090
But fate involved Aoi in the 
Lost Incident from way before.

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:54.500
Your fighting style is beautiful.

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:58.170
But I'll still win!

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:00.880
Stop joking!

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:03.770
I can’t afford to lose!

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:06.640
Not until I regain Miyu’s consciousness!

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:09.100
It wasn’t just us.

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:15.070
Blue Maiden is also fighting 
to regain something she lost.

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:21.060
She's another person who's life was 
altered due to the Lost Incident.

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:23.410
Seems you still want to fight.

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:27.330
Then I'll show you the absolute 
difference in our powers!

00:18:31.280 --> 00:18:34.990
We feel it here too?  What’s going on?

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:38.230
It’s affecting all of Mirror World!

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:41.440
No, not just Mirror World!

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:44.170
Even the original LINK VRAINS!

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:54.050
What’s going on?

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:56.350
What what what?

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:01.700
This is dangerous for real!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:04.490
I should log out.

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:07.770
Huh?

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:15.910
I can’t log out?

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:20.140
Ahh!  What’s going on?

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:23.400
What?  We can’t access the program?

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:28.890
That’s right!  Someone must've 
taken over LINK VRAINS’s systems!

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:29.850
No way!

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:32.860
I am LINK VRAINS itself.

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:35.850
LINK VRAINS is me!

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:47.300
You’re just squirming 
in the palm of my hand.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:50.750
I can easily squish you.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:55.040
But you’ll still continue this duel?

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.780
Of course!

00:19:56.780 --> 00:20:00.010
So that’s your answer.  Fine!

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:04.510
I set one card and end my turn.

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:07.560
My turn!

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:10.590
I draw!

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:12.530
It’s here!

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:19.760
I activate the Continuous Spell, Marincess 
Bubble Blast from my hand on Crystal Heart!

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:26.770
When a Marincess is summoned or Special 
Summoned next to Crystal Heart’s link...

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:33.490
...for every Link Marker that 
they have, you take 500 damage!

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:37.690
But when this card activates, 
I can't attack that turn.

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:42.480
She gave up attacking to use effect damage.

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:45.030
That's her go-to strategy.

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:49.950
Due to Sea Horse’s effect, I 
can Special Summon Sea Horse

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:53.000
from my hand next to a Marincess 
Link Monster’s link.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:59.170
But Sea Horse’s effects are negated.

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:01.640
Property Zero!

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:09.160
But since Sea Horse was Special Summoned 
next to Crystal Heart’s link...

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:13.430
...Bubble Blast deals you damage for 
each of Crystal Heart’s Link Markers.

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:16.550
You take 1000 damage!

00:21:16.550 --> 00:21:18.000
I won’t allow that!

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:24.940
I activate the Continuous Trap, Interference 
Canceller on Cubic Hydradrive Lord!

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:28.640
Your card effect's damage becomes 0!

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:35.980
On the turn it's activated, this effect can be 
used for every Link Marker that the target has.

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:39.390
Cubic Hydradrive Lord has three Link Markers.

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:44.750
That means he can negate 
effect damage two more times.

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:46.120
You’re wrong, Aqua.

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:50.890
Not two "more."  "Only" twice!

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:54.240
I can’t deal effect damage "only" twice!

00:21:54.240 --> 00:21:55.860
That’s all there is to it!

00:21:57.480 --> 00:22:03.600
No matter what, I’ll never give up!

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:23.670
Trapped in conventionality

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:25.110
Even denials are obvious

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:26.240
That There This Whichever

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:28.080
Hey, isn't it true?

00:22:28.410 --> 00:22:29.740
Why is it before you wake up

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:31.310
You build a wall, saying it's impossible

00:22:31.310 --> 00:22:32.480
No discussions, no ideals

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:39.520
Even together, it's not the same

00:22:39.820 --> 00:22:42.590
Break yourself through  go way

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:45.730
Even if you lose your 
way, keep moving forward

00:22:46.060 --> 00:22:48.800
Our desires won't be stopped

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:57.370
Let your emotions spill

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:03.510
Keep rewriting  only glory

00:23:03.910 --> 00:23:08.920
If we're together

00:23:09.220 --> 00:23:12.320
We can seize it

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:43.200
Bohman's duel transcends anger and 
hate, evolving into perfection.

00:23:43.200 --> 00:23:49.140
Even against such an opponent, 
Blue Maiden won't give up.

00:23:49.140 --> 00:23:54.390
Her friendship and radiance don't falter.

00:23:54.390 --> 00:23:57.650
I'm fine.  I can still fight!

00:23:57.650 --> 00:24:02.050
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Proud Maiden

00:24:02.050 --> 00:24:04.300
Into the VRAINS!
